      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003eSo, if doing this like pKVM-ARM does it not easy to implement right now, we may keep this BUG_ON for now (maybe just change it to an error return) and just add a FIXME, like I suggested?\n\nTo avoid crash the system, but let it continue running without pKVM, seems return an error code is better. Anyway, yeah, adding a FIXME sounds good to me, and we can refactor this later.",
